is very brittle.

00:48:15.416 --> 00:48:18.050
Whenever we have a new subject

00:48:18.051 --> 00:48:20.920
and particular more larger
and more complex subject,

00:48:20.921 --> 00:48:23.320
we typically run into bugs in

